T:the state of
T:the Earth's
T:atmosphere
T:at a
T:specific
T:place and
T:time,
T:typically
T:described in
T:terms of
T:temperature,
T:humidity,
T:cloud cover,
T:and
T:stability.
T:On Earth,
T:most weather
T:phenomena
T:occur in the
T:lowest layer
T:of the
T:planet's
T:atmosphere,
T:the
T:troposphere,
T:just below
T:the
T:stratospher.
